    {
        "content": "<p>I think you need to extend <code>f</code> and <code>g</code> to whole <code>α</code> (just give them junk value outside <code>p</code>) otherwise <code>(hf : Measurable f) (hg : Measurable g)</code> does not make sense. Then your function <code>fun x =&gt; if h : p x then f h x else g h x</code> is just <code>f * (characteristic function of p) + g * (1 - characteristic function of p)</code> which is a combination of measurable functions, hence measurable.</p>",
        "id": 591429189,
        "sender_full_name": "Jz Pan",
        "timestamp": 1777393231
    },
